      "id": "rkdME",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> are in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> represents a family of lines passing through the point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>So, the family of circles (concentric) will be given by <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>radius</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
